# Complete pip-installed layer for the Linux/Python 3.10 Modal image.
#
# Versions preserve the deployed scientific runtime captured from Modal image
# im-36XJVrZ7ZOw2lMwtjVXrzE on 2026-08-12. rfc8785 and shapely are the exact
# Phase-0 contract additions already declared by pyproject.toml.
#
# Regenerate requirements-modal.lock for x86_64-manylinux_2_36 with hashes and
# --no-deps. Conda supplies NumPy and the remaining native scientific stack.
